{"ref":"BDB, שֶׁבְנָא","hw":"שֶׁבְנָא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁבְנָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁבְנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> secretary and major-domo of Hezekiah; -<span dir=\"rtl\">נָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.15\">Is 22:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.22\">36:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.2\">37:2</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:37\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.37\">2 K 18:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.2\">19:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.3\">Is 36:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.11\">11</a> = -<span dir=\"rtl\">נָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.18\">2 K 18:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.26\">26</a>.—Σομνας.","next":"BDB, שְׁבַנְיָה(וּ)","prev":"BDB, שׁבן"}